# viewer/gaia/.gitignore — Gaia retention boundary / repo-bloat fence
#
# GAIA LAW persistence contract (see docs/GAIA.md, file_manifest > persistence):
#   Code-as-truth  +  append-only content-addressed hashed snapshots.
#
# KEEP committed (provenance must survive pruning):
#   - every viewer/gaia/*.cjs, caps.cjs, sources.json, gaia.html   (code-as-truth)
#   - snapshots/index.ndjson  — the append-only committed hashed-capture index.
#     Any pruned raw capture stays RE-VERIFIABLE by re-running its locator +
#     rehashing, because its {id_or_path,seat,captured_at,sha256,path} line lives
#     here forever.
#
# IGNORE (volatile capture BYTES — must never balloon the checkout;
#   precedent hazard: phase2_metabolism_red.jsonl.gz was 526KB):
#   - snapshots/live/**             volatile agent-ingested MCP captures
#                                   (last-N-per-seat retention on disk only)
#   - snapshots/<seat>.<ts>.<sha8>.json  per-seat content-addressed envelopes
#
# This fence is DATA-only; it changes no signal, computes nothing, and asserts
# no verdict — it is not part of the signal path.

# --- volatile agent-ingested MCP / live captures (retention-managed on disk) ---
snapshots/live/

# --- per-seat content-addressed capture envelopes: <seat>.<captured_at>.<sha8>.json ---
snapshots/*.json

# --- but ALWAYS keep the append-only provenance index committed ---
# (index.ndjson is .ndjson so *.json above never matches it; the explicit
#  re-include documents intent and guards against a future broadened pattern.)
!snapshots/index.ndjson
!snapshots/.gitkeep

# --- Gaia is hand-rolled on node builtins + local ./*.cjs ONLY (no third-party
#     dep, per the repo no-third-party-dep invariant). Guard against a stray
#     install ballooning the checkout. ---
node_modules/

# --- editor / OS scratch ---
*.swp
*.tmp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
